Start with the [current setup page](teaching/phys3810-fa2026/SETUP.md).
The included [student PDF](teaching/phys3810-fa2026/handouts/PHYS3810_Full_Course_Student_Setup_v0.1_REVIEW_DRAFT.pdf)
